 ('Sennet/Tucket harnesses duplicate verdict and supervision authority','Both scripts have copied Wait-Ready,Start/Stop-Broker,Invoke-Probe,Watch-Custody and aggregate report construction.',['testing/run_sennet_custody.ps1','testing/run_tucket_custody.ps1'],'Q464normal verdict is not checked, while Watch-Custody correctly requires custody_closed. Fresh output, executable before/after hashes and synthetic wallets are real protections. Sources listed in a report are currentruntime inputs, not proof supplied executables were built from them; generated wallets are honestly retained/ignored, not falsely claimed deleted.'),
